  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">House of Hope for Ukrainian Refugees</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One Humanity Institute (OHI) is creating a Welcome Center that will provide transitional housing and permanent residence for families rendered homeless by Putin&apos;s war. Located in the historic center of Osweicim Poland, OHI will renovate two buildings to provide much needed housing and personal services. OHI has been on the border touching many lives with our teddy bears, translators and supplies. Now it is time to provide housing. THE REFUGEES NEED OUR HELP AND WE NEED YOURS TO MAKE THIS HAPPEN!</narrative>
  </description>
